674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OTyV0DZP6bMQ7kNvwGE3Zg5&_nc_oc=AdpT2JE3DPhtbV_8QT-KvnHy38mcMQULgUXM4zRAjHsfnNRVMpRQblzkCNI8qOZNK1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6oDIoN2sRnBAxU4B8nDcoANtpqtFkEItOyPR76RnzzLA&oe=6A1851D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AP9npfXB5WcQ7kNvwHUR3yl&_nc_oc=AdrJgyJ2N9zI45wD6wdeEfH2OXexHYEeSPGPqSAmFt-UqkgMxuVywUQLLUq4f17BQWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af478pzFlc4AedJypR3Y3u38WNvUhTqlDz0UIVkv8gb5tg&oe=6A185A96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oeI_rm-yzjwQ7kNvwHOwxfQ&_nc_oc=AdqH1-R212rRJOflaRkpT42H5FmUswoIo4Zzchrsxf4ZksStQaaZM_VgojCd0Lp2Dco&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4-f1BEbMIr-koUcMQ04bJWNb9mqbweGBSCHr7qw7Io8g&oe=6A1856B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip